Same idea for Vector Databases

Suppose documents are stored like:

Document
Plant A Maintenance Manual

Metadata:
plant_id=A
Document
Plant B Maintenance Manual

Metadata:
plant_id=B

When Manager A asks:

Why did Machine 17 fail?

The retrieval layer adds a filter:

plant_id=A

during vector search.

So instead of:

Search entire vector DB

it performs:

Search vector DB
WHERE plant_id=A

Only Plant A documents are retrieved.